# The sdist ships the test suite (setuptools picks up tests/test*.py on its own),
# so it has to ship everything that suite imports or reads:
#   - conftest.py and the shared fakes the terminal and MCP tests drive
#   - probes/: the captured generator replies test_json_repair reads by path
# Without this the tarball carried 39 test modules that could not be collected,
# plus two that failed on a missing fixture. Found by unpacking the release and
# running it -- which is now a job in ci.yml, and was briefly a job in
# tool-market's reproduce workflow before it moved to the repo that can fix it.
recursive-include tests *.py
recursive-include probes *.txt *.md *.py
